{"title":"Cyprus MO Problems and Solutions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Cyprus Mathematical Olympiad\">Cyprus Mathematical Olympiad</a> (CMO) problems and solutions:\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"By_Test\">By Test</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_MO_Problems_and_Solutions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: By Test\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_MO_Problems_and_Solutions/4th_grade\" title=\"Cyprus MO Problems and Solutions/4th grade\">4th grade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_MO_Problems_and_Solutions/5th_grade\" title=\"Cyprus MO Problems and Solutions/5th grade\">5th grade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_MO_Problems_and_Solutions/6th_grade\" title=\"Cyprus MO Problems and Solutions/6th grade\">6th grade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_MO_Problems_and_Solutions/Gymnasium\" title=\"Cyprus MO Problems and Solutions/Gymnasium\">Gymnasium</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_MO_Problems_and_Solutions/Lyceum\" title=\"Cyprus MO Problems and Solutions/Lyceum\">Lyceum</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"By_Year\">By Year</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_MO_Problems_and_Solutions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: By Year\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Cyprus_MO\" title=\"2000 Cyprus MO\">2000 Cyprus MO</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Cyprus_MO\" title=\"2001 Cyprus MO\">2001 Cyprus MO</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?tit